{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fortress labyrinth crawling with monsters, defending yourself with your... tongue? As a frog, it's your best bet to traverse the demo of this retro-inspired 2D metroidvania title. This special demo contains a unique map shrunken down for bite-sized exploration! In this map, you'll be able to discover and utilize many accessories, powers, and equippable tongue-whips to face off against enemies. Gear up and prepare for the looming threat you will face at the castle's zenith. Customize your stats with a variety of item pickups to build a playstyle you prefer!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lakeside castle awaits your arrival... Will you heed its call and brave the night?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4020560?t=1759350794","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020560/2bc6776bacc0175188f10cd22b41572cd6a9074b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759350794","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020560/ccdc68c7c1f0f6a941275b63e8a96f76ee6abb47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759350794","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4020560/ccdc68c7c1f0f6a941275b63e8a96f76ee6abb47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759350794","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a fortress labyrinth crawling with monsters, defending yourself with your... tongue? As a frog, it's your best bet to traverse the demo of this retro-inspired 2D metroidvania title. This special demo contains a unique map shrunken down for bite-sized exploration! In this map, you'll be able to discover and utilize many accessories, powers, and equ